https://sound.media.mit.edu/resources/KEMAR.html

The MIT KEMAR data is provided free with no restrictions on use, provided
the authors are cited when the data is used in research or commercial work.
The filter assets here are derived from the MIT_KEMAR_normal_pinna.sofa
dataset supplied by libmysofa, sampled through its 48 kHz interpolator.
These are generic dummy-head measurements, not measurements of this user
or of Steam Deck speakers. No Dolby or BACCH implementation is included.
